# While the Navigator is open, outline keys such as undo, cut, select all and pane focus do nothing to the pane behind it.
file <<END
Work:
	- Report
	- Email
END
keys j x <C-g> <C-z> <C-x> <C-a> <A-1> <A-j> <Tab> <Del> <C-o>
see Navigator
keys <Esc>
hide Navigator
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Report @done({today})
	- Email
END
